T22 Principal Critical #1 correction — Kubernetes exact authentication edge

Summary:
- Replaced UI4A and Keycloak catch-all VirtualService routes with method-aware fixed allowlists and terminal HTTP 404 default deny.
- UI4A exposes public HTML/static assets, health/version/login/callback/logout, and only the credential-adjudicated business/Meta Golden routes from auth-surface.md.
- Deferred dynamic routes including raw events, chat history/session, delegations APIs, presentation/sidecar, Meta sitemap and direct /api/meta aliases are not routed.
